WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:02.935
-The fifth Democratic debate
was last week,

00:00:02.935 --> 00:00:04.503
and all the candidates
came out swinging.

00:00:04.503 --> 00:00:06.172
You know I was gonna make
a joke about this,

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:07.540
but I don't think
it needs a joke.

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:09.409
I think it needs to be
slow-jammed.

00:00:09.409 --> 00:00:10.510
You know what
I'm talking about, Tariq?

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:11.811
-Yeah, Jimmy.

00:00:11.811 --> 00:00:14.147
I think you're saying you'd like
to slow-jam this news.

00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:15.714
-That's right -- I want to
slow-jam the news,

00:00:15.714 --> 00:00:18.584
and I'm not the only one.

00:00:18.584 --> 00:00:20.620
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:38.404
-Thank you.

00:00:38.404 --> 00:00:42.942
Thank you.

00:00:42.942 --> 00:00:46.045
[ Crowd chants "Bernie!" ]

00:00:46.045 --> 00:00:50.483
Thank you.

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:54.154
Hello.
I'm Senator Bernie Sanders.

00:00:54.154 --> 00:00:59.292
And I, too, would like to
slow-jam this news.

00:00:59.292 --> 00:01:03.796
-Hit me five times!
♪♪

00:01:03.796 --> 00:01:06.833
[ Slow R&amp;B music playing ]

00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:18.711
-During last week's debate,
I went toe-to-toe

00:01:18.711 --> 00:01:23.116
with my fellow Democrats
on the issues that matter most.

00:01:23.116 --> 00:01:27.987
We need to defeat Trump,
the most dangerous president

00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:29.355
in American history.

00:01:29.355 --> 00:01:32.959
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:32.959 --> 00:01:36.128
But we need to do more.

00:01:36.128 --> 00:01:39.231
We can no longer tolerate
three people

00:01:39.231 --> 00:01:43.402
owning more wealth than
the bottom half of America.

00:01:43.402 --> 00:01:47.773
I have the experience to fight
for that bottom half

00:01:47.773 --> 00:01:52.044
and to create an economy that
works for all of us,

00:01:52.044 --> 00:01:54.380
not just those on top.

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:57.983
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:57.983 --> 00:02:01.019
-Oh, yeah.

00:02:01.019 --> 00:02:06.092
Bernie Sanders is looking out
for your bottom half.

00:02:06.092 --> 00:02:09.228
He knows it's been
neglected for too long.

00:02:09.228 --> 00:02:13.999
Now he wants to pay it some
extra-special attention.

00:02:13.999 --> 00:02:19.738
He's sick and tired of having
just a few people on top.

00:02:19.738 --> 00:02:24.109
That's why Bernie's here to
spread the love.

00:02:24.109 --> 00:02:27.546
-♪ Wanna spread
a little bit of love, y'all ♪

00:02:27.546 --> 00:02:31.483
♪ 50 years of service,
giving people the power ♪

00:02:31.483 --> 00:02:39.525
♪ He's heard it all, except
the words "please talk louder" ♪

00:02:39.525 --> 00:02:45.731
-Now, tell me, "Woke Doc Brown,"
lately, this country's been

00:02:45.731 --> 00:02:49.968
experimenting with
all the wrong positions.

00:02:49.968 --> 00:02:54.640
So what's your plan to bring us
back to the future?

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:57.744
-Well, let's start here.

00:02:57.744 --> 00:03:01.180
We need to enact
Medicare for all.

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:03.850
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:09.322
We need to tackle the dangerous
threat of climate change.

00:03:09.322 --> 00:03:12.358
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:12.358 --> 00:03:16.329
And we need to get
Big Money out of politics.

00:03:16.329 --> 00:03:19.431
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:19.431 --> 00:03:22.068
I don't have a super PAC.

00:03:22.068 --> 00:03:25.204
Instead, I have
a grassroots campaign

00:03:25.204 --> 00:03:29.775
with more individual
contributions than any candidate

00:03:29.775 --> 00:03:31.143
in American history.

00:03:31.143 --> 00:03:33.679
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:33.679 --> 00:03:40.719
I am proud of the donations
we receive, no matter how small.

00:03:40.719 --> 00:03:43.923
-Mm-mm-mm!

00:03:43.923 --> 00:03:47.293
You got to listen to my
bed-headed brougham.

00:03:47.293 --> 00:03:49.928
He might not have a super PAC,

00:03:49.928 --> 00:03:53.165
but he's packin'
something super.

00:03:53.165 --> 00:03:55.534
He's all about
taking a firm stance

00:03:55.534 --> 00:04:01.373
against corporations to give
the people what they desire.

00:04:01.373 --> 00:04:06.145
-I know you're joking,
but it actually is quite sexy.

00:04:06.145 --> 00:04:08.181
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:14.587 --> 00:04:18.690
-Man, just the way you said that
has got me feelin' the "Bern."

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:20.226
And thanks to Medicare for all,

00:04:20.226 --> 00:04:23.763
I can get it
checked out by my doctor,

00:04:23.763 --> 00:04:25.664
'cause this hunka-hunka
Bernie love --

00:04:25.664 --> 00:04:29.535
well, he wants to take care
of all of our bodies.

00:04:29.535 --> 00:04:32.104
-♪ Bernie loves
your body, baby ♪

00:04:32.104 --> 00:04:36.108
♪ He'll bring Medicare
to all consumers ♪

00:04:36.108 --> 00:04:43.215
♪ And if you can't dig that,
then, okay, Boomer ♪

00:04:43.215 --> 00:04:46.551
-Now, Senator, I was hoping
you could take a minute

00:04:46.551 --> 00:04:49.922
and talk Bernie to me.

00:04:49.922 --> 00:04:52.325
We all know you've got
a huge heart.

00:04:52.325 --> 00:04:53.792
[ Music stops ]
-No, no.

00:04:53.792 --> 00:04:57.596
It's a normal-sized heart.

00:04:57.596 --> 00:05:02.635
It's a completely normal,
completely fine heart.

00:05:02.635 --> 00:05:04.671
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:09.141 --> 00:05:12.811
But continue.
[ Music continues ]

00:05:12.811 --> 00:05:15.981
-Well, now that you bring it up,
what do you say to people

00:05:15.981 --> 00:05:21.854
who think "The Sandman" is
too...mature to be president?

00:05:21.854 --> 00:05:25.791
-Well, to those people, I'd say
that I'm feeling

00:05:25.791 --> 00:05:30.129
strong, energetic,
and more ready than ever

00:05:30.129 --> 00:05:32.631
to fight for
the American people.

00:05:32.631 --> 00:05:35.001
-Hold up.
[ Music stops ]

00:05:35.001 --> 00:05:36.869
So what you're saying is...

00:05:36.869 --> 00:05:40.173
♪ I do my hair toss,
check my nails ♪

00:05:40.173 --> 00:05:42.575
♪ Bernie, how you feelin'? ♪

00:05:42.575 --> 00:05:45.144
♪ Hair toss,
check my nails ♪

00:05:45.144 --> 00:05:47.012
♪ Bernie, how you feelin'? ♪

00:05:47.012 --> 00:05:49.081
-Feelin' good as hell.

00:05:49.081 --> 00:05:51.083
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:51.083 --> 00:05:53.419
[ Slow R&amp;B music playing ]

00:05:53.419 --> 00:05:57.656
-Alright.
One last question before we

00:05:57.656 --> 00:06:01.560
wham, bam, thank you, Sand,
this interview.

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:04.430
I made a lot of jokes
about you in the past

00:06:04.430 --> 00:06:06.499
and I even do
a Bernie impression

00:06:06.499 --> 00:06:10.069
that some say is pretty good.

00:06:10.069 --> 00:06:12.438
But I was thinking,
now that you're here,

00:06:12.438 --> 00:06:16.008
do you want to do
a Jimmy impression?

00:06:16.008 --> 00:06:20.446
-Ha ha!

00:06:20.446 --> 00:06:23.182
-Are you gonna do
an impression of me?

00:06:23.182 --> 00:06:26.986
-Jimmy, that was
my impression of you.

00:06:26.986 --> 00:06:32.825
-♪ Jimmy's got
a third-degree burn ♪

00:06:32.825 --> 00:06:37.863
-We must choose a leader
who fights for what's fair.

00:06:37.863 --> 00:06:43.236
-Who cares more about
the people and less about hair.

00:06:43.236 --> 00:06:45.203
-♪ Cares less about hair ♪

00:06:45.203 --> 00:06:46.272
♪ Listen ♪

00:06:46.272 --> 00:06:48.274
♪ Our battle's uphill ♪

00:06:48.274 --> 00:06:50.276
♪ We cannot stand still ♪

00:06:50.276 --> 00:06:53.979
♪ We'll write our new page like
we wrote the damn bill ♪

00:06:53.979 --> 00:06:57.816
♪ It starts with a Bern,
then a fire breaks loose ♪

00:06:57.816 --> 00:07:01.453
-And that is how
we slow-jam the news.

00:07:01.453 --> 00:07:04.690
-Oh, yeah!

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:07.026
-Give it up for
Senator Bernie Sanders!

